# Keep Unix line endings in every checkout, including the Windows CI runner.
# The website serves these installer scripts, and tests compare the copies in webapp/public with what the
# routes generate byte for byte. Without these rules git turns them into CRLF on Windows and the
# "static Windows installer matches the served script" check fails (it broke the v4.0.23 release).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
